TrueNas Presentation

What is a NAS 
  NAS means Network Attache Storage
  It usually refers to a device that is meant solely for storage, just like a google drive

What's TrueNas ?
  TrueNas is a Linux based Operating System made to create and manage a NAS device.
  It can be installed on any x32-64 x86 or ARM device to make it into a special server, that you can tailor to your needs.
  The OS is quite light, making it a pretty good choice for older hardware, which mean if you have an older computer that's been sitting in a dark drawer, it could be time to make it to good use !
